{"type":"standard","title":"Nen language (Cameroon)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Nen language (Cameroon)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q36632","titles":{"canonical":"Nen_language_(Cameroon)","normalized":"Nen language (Cameroon)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Nen language (Cameroon)</span></span>"},"pageid":33488383,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1356016604","tid":"51c554c2-580a-11f1-a3f5-857bf803b356","timestamp":"2026-05-25T07:21:17Z","description":"Mbam language spoken in Cameroon","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nen_language_(Cameroon)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nen_language_(Cameroon)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nen_language_(Cameroon)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Nen_language_(Cameroon)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nen_language_(Cameroon)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Nen_language_(Cameroon)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nen_language_(Cameroon)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Nen_language_(Cameroon)"}},"extract":"The Nen language, Tunen (Banen), is a Mbam language of Cameroon. Maho (2009) considers Aling'a to be a distinct language. Unlike all other Bantu languages, Nen has an SOV word order rather than the standard Bantu SVO word order.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>Nen language</b>, <i><b>Tunen</b></i> (<i>Banen</i>), is a Mbam language of Cameroon. Maho (2009) considers Aling'a to be a distinct language. Unlike all other Bantu languages, Nen has an SOV word order rather than the standard Bantu SVO word order.</p>"}